  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ENSURING THE LONG-TERM PROTECTION OF CONKOUATI DOULI NATIONAL PARK, REPUBLIC OF CONGO</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is to support a Conservation effort in Conkouati Douli National Park, Republic of Congo, by improving park management, protection, and capacity. The project is intended to primarily conserve the park&apos;s.populations of forest elephants, chimpanzees, gorillas, coastal dolphins, leatherback and olive ridley sea turtles, and large monkeys, as well as other threatened and iconic forest and aquatic species such as pangolins and manatees.</narrative>
  </description>
